      "message": "Global variables like this make testing hard because the state will not be cleared between tests.  Use a ctx.Once() to store the SyncedJarList (or just store a []string in the Once() and use a global mutex).",
      "revId": "de3358fdf4e598e6a6a2e1e59616021292f74849",
